- If a competitor is specified, focus comparisons on evidence in Project 3. If the reports do not support a claim, state that the data is unavailable rather than guessing.
- If an input is blank, use the fallback guidance above and continue without asking follow-up questions.
- Include a concise `content_context` object in the JSON output showing the audience, seasonal context, content focus, product focus, and competitor focus used. Use `Not specified` or the fallback actually applied when a field was blank.

=== PROJECT 2 (Market Analysis) ===
{{ $json.p2_content }}

=== PROJECT 3 (Competitor Analysis) ===
{{ $json.p3_content }}

